# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
debug
target

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these, which store debugging information
*.pdb

# Generated by cargo mutants
# Contains mutation testing data
**/mutants.out*/

# RustRover
#  JetBrains specific template is maintained in a separate JetBrains.gitignore that can
#  be found at https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Global/JetBrains.gitignore
#  and can be added to the global gitignore or merged into this file.  For a more nuclear
#  option (not recommended) you can uncomment the following to ignore the entire idea folder.
#.idea/

# Internal architecture notes (see concepts/README.md), anchored to the repository
# root. ROADMAP.md is the spec of specs: every open item names its feature
# specification. `CONCEPT.md` is the pre-split single-file form; both are ignored
# so a draft in either shape stays local.
#
# The third-party corpus — the OCMF specification (CC BY-ND 4.0), the S.A.F.E.
# Transparenzsoftware and the OCA application note — lives at `concepts/reference/`
# and is covered by this line: fetched at its pins by `cargo xtask spec-sync`
# (`$OCMF_REFERENCE` overrides the location), never committed, and indexed in
# `concepts/REFERENCES.md`.
/concepts/
/CONCEPT.md

# This project's own feature specifications, and the Spec Kit machinery that
# produces them: one `specs/NNN-slug/` per ROADMAP item, `.specify/memory/constitution.md`,
# the threatspec extension, and the `/speckit-*` skills. Same rule as `concepts/` —
# internal, and the published tree may not cite a path its reader does not have;
# `scripts/concepts-check.sh` fails on one that does.
#
# Until 2026-11-20 `specs/` held the corpus now under `concepts/reference/`; a stale
# copy is ignored by the same line. Matches ocpp-kit, eebus and metering.
/specs/
/.specify/
/.claude/
.DS_Store

# Zola build output
/site/public/

# cargo-fuzz artefacts and corpora
/fuzz/target/
/fuzz/corpus/
/fuzz/artifacts/
/fuzz/coverage/
